g/tracks/one-more-chance-woody-remix-feat-carlitta-durand.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"B4wUXA68Ogo","slug":"369","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-369/ra.1418960479","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-369-live-from-tokyo-ft-yukibeb"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #369 w/Yukibeb","artwork":"/images/episodes/369.jpg","content":"Joe Kay meets up with Japanese DJ [Yukibeb](https://twitter.com/yukibeb) drops a 60-minutes guest mix live in Tokyo.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n\n---\n\nToday we're introducing the Black Label Series, which is focused on highlighting rising vocalists/rappers we're going to be working with.\n\nAs smooth as they are soulful, LA-based group Hablot Brown gives us 5 original tracks that will grab you by the heartstrings. From the vocals to guitar-infused production, the first ever Black Label release will make it hard for you to not follow their journey.\n\nDiscover:<br>\n[soundcloud.com/hablotbrown](https://soundcloud.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[twitter.com/hablotbrown](https://twitter.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[instagram.com/hablotbrown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7226,"location":"JP","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"},"title":"Yukibeb Set","position":1}},{"id":"bEkWcrMDUZQ","position":31,"timestamp":"01:45:05","rawTrack":"The Notorious B.I.G - I Got A Story To Tell (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"2SMo4idiG98","path":"/artists/the-notorious-b-i-g/tracks/i-got-a-story-to-tell-instrumental/","slug":"i-got-a-story-to-tell-instrumental","title":"I Got A Story To Tell (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"the-notorious-big","title":"The Notorious B.I.G."},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F08AYCRDeTQ","slug":"452","tags":[6,3,6,11,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/e